
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>大懶豹國際娛樂 — Big Lazy Seals</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --red: #E8272A;
  --yellow: #FFD600;
  --black: #111111;
  --white: #FAFAF5;
  --gray: #F0EFE8;
  --text: #222222;
}

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--text);
  overflow-x: hidden;
  cursor: none;
}

/* Custom cursor */
.cursor {
  width: 14px; height: 14px;
  background: var(--red);
  border-radius: 50%;
  position: fixed;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 9999;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  transition: transform 0.1s, width 0.2s, height 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}
.cursor.big { width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--yellow); }

/* NAV */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
  background: var(--white);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--black);
}
.nav-logo {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--black); text-decoration: none;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
}
.nav-logo .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--red); border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a {
  font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--black);
  text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  position: relative; padding-bottom: 2px;
}
.nav-links a::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0;
  width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--red);
  transition: width 0.2s;
}
.nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

/* HERO */
.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 8rem 2.5rem 4rem;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3rem;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-bg {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
  background: 
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(232,39,42,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(255,214,0,0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);
}
.hero-ticker {
  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  background: var(--black); color: var(--yellow);
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700;
  padding: 0.6rem 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--black);
}
.ticker-inner {
  display: inline-block;
  animation: ticker 20s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes ticker {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
}
.hero-left { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.hero-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black);
  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.hero-title {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.hero-title .accent { color: var(--red); }
.hero-title .underline {
  position: relative; display: inline-block;
}
.hero-title .underline::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; bottom: 4px; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 6px; background: var(--yellow);
  z-index: -1;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: 1rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 420px;
}
.hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn-primary {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: var(--red); color: #fff;
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--red);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--red); }
.btn-outline {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: transparent; color: var(--black);
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--black);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.btn-outline:hover { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }

/* Hero right - big seal illustration */
.hero-right {
  position: relative; z-index: 1;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.hero-card {
  background: var(--black); color: var(--white);
  border-radius: 24px; padding: 2.5rem;
  width: 100%; max-width: 380px;
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; top: -40px; right: -40px;
  width: 160px; height: 160px;
  background: var(--red); border-radius: 50%; opacity: 0.15;
}
.hero-card-tag {
  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--yellow); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.hero-card-title {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.3;
}
.hero-card-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.hero-card-meta {
  display: flex; gap: 1rem;
}
.meta-item { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
.meta-item strong { display: block; color: var(--white); font-size: 1rem; }
.soon-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black);
  font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.floating-tag {
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--white); border: 2px solid var(--black);
  border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black);
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--black);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.floating-tag.t1 { bottom: -1rem; left: -2rem; animation: float1 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
.floating-tag.t2 { top: 2rem; left: -2.5rem; animation: float2 3.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes float1 { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(-8px)} }
@keyframes float2 { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(6px)} }

/* SECTIONS common */
section { padding: 5rem 2.5rem; }
.section-label {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.section-label::before {
  content: ''; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--red);
}
.section-title {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* ABOUT */
.about { background: var(--gray); }
.about-inner {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem; align-items: center; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.about-visual {
  position: relative;
}
.about-card-stack { position: relative; height: 340px; }
.acard {
  position: absolute; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.5rem;
  width: 260px;
}
.acard.c1 {
  background: var(--red); color: #fff;
  top: 0; left: 0;
  transform: rotate(-3deg);
  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--black);
}
.acard.c2 {
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black);
  top: 60px; left: 80px;
  transform: rotate(2deg);
  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--black);
}
.acard.c3 {
  background: var(--black); color: var(--white);
  top: 140px; left: 20px;
  transform: rotate(-1deg);
  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--red);
}
.acard .card-emoji { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.acard .card-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.acard .card-desc { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.8; line-height: 1.5; }
.about-text p {
  font-size: 1rem; color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.about-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
.tag {
  background: var(--black); color: var(--white);
  font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700;
  padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px;
}
.tag.red { background: var(--red); }
.tag.yellow { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black); }

/* EVENTS */
.events { background: var(--white); }
.events-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
.events-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
.event-card {
  border: 2px solid var(--black); border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}
.event-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black); }
.event-header {
  background: var(--black); padding: 1.5rem;
  position: relative;
}
.event-date {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--yellow); line-height: 1;
}
.event-month { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
.event-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1rem;
  background: var(--red); color: #fff;
  font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800;
  padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
}
.event-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
.event-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.event-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.event-meta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #888; }
.event-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.coming-soon-card {
  border: 2px dashed #CCC; border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
  min-height: 220px; color: #999;
}
.coming-soon-card .big { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.coming-soon-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }

/* SURVEY */
.survey { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }
.survey-inner {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem; align-items: center;
}
.survey .section-label { color: var(--yellow); }
.survey .section-label::before { background: var(--yellow); }
.survey .section-title { color: var(--white); }
.survey-desc { font-size: 1rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.survey-perks { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.perk {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
  padding: 1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
}
.perk-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.perk-text strong { display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 2px; }
.perk-text span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
.survey-visual {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-radius: 24px; padding: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
}
.survey-prize {
  font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.survey-prize-title {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.survey-prize-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.btn-yellow {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black);
  font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--yellow);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.btn-yellow:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--yellow); }

/* PODCAST */
.podcast { background: var(--gray); }
.podcast-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
.podcast-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; align-items: start; }
.podcast-main {
  background: var(--black); border-radius: 24px; padding: 2rem;
  color: var(--white); position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.podcast-main::after {
  content: '🎙️'; position: absolute;
  font-size: 6rem; bottom: -1rem; right: -1rem; opacity: 0.15;
}
.podcast-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--yellow); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.podcast-name { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.podcast-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.platform-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
.platform-link {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  text-decoration: none; color: var(--white);
  font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;
  transition: all 0.2s; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}
.platform-link:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); background: rgba(255,214,0,0.08); }
.platform-link .pl-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; }
.platform-link .pl-label { flex: 1; }
.platform-link .pl-arrow { opacity: 0.4; font-size: 0.8rem; }
.reels-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
.reel-card {
  background: var(--white); border: 2px solid var(--black);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.2rem;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.reel-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--black); }
.reel-num { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--red); line-height: 1; }
.reel-unit { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; font-weight: 500; }
.reel-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
.ig-cta {
  grid-column: span 2;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f09433, #e6683c, #dc2743, #cc2366, #bc1888);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  text-decoration: none; color: #fff;
  transition: opacity 0.2s;
}
.ig-cta:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
.ig-cta-left strong { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; }
.ig-cta-left span { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.85; }
.ig-cta-arrow { font-size: 1.4rem; }

/* CONTACT */
.contact { background: var(--white); }
.contact-inner {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem; align-items: start;
}
.contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
.form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
.form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.form-group label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.form-group input,
.form-group textarea,
.form-group select {
  border: 2px solid var(--black); border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--text); background: var(--white);
  outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s;
  appearance: none;
}
.form-group input:focus,
.form-group textarea:focus { border-color: var(--red); }
.form-group textarea { min-height: 100px; resize: vertical; }
.contact-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
.contact-item {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px;
  padding: 1.2rem; border: 2px solid var(--black);
  border-radius: 16px; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.contact-item:hover { background: var(--gray); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--black); }
.contact-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.contact-detail strong { display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px; }
.contact-detail span { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #666; }
.contact-detail a { color: var(--red); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }

/* FOOTER */
footer {
  background: var(--black); color: var(--white);
  padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--red);
}
.footer-logo {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800;
}
.footer-logo span { color: var(--red); }
.footer-copy { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #666; }
.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
.footer-links a { color: #888; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.8rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }

/* ANIMATIONS */
.fade-up {
  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
  transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
}
.fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  nav { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; }
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 6rem 1.2rem 5rem; }
  .hero-right { display: none; }
  section { padding: 3.5rem 1.2rem; }
  .about-inner, .survey-inner, .contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .about-card-stack { display: none; }
  .podcast-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .reels-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; text-align: center; }
  .footer-links { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo"><span class="dot"></span> Big Lazy Seals</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">關於我們</a></li>
    <li><a href="#events">即將上映</a></li>
    <li><a href="#survey">問卷抽獎</a></li>
    <li><a href="#podcast">自媒體</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">聯絡我們</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">🎬 大懶豹國際娛樂</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      讓家鄉的電影<br>
      在台灣<br>
      <span class="underline accent">大螢幕</span>上映
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">我們是 Ray & James，兩位熱愛電影的好朋友。正在為在台灣的印尼朋友打造一個專屬的電影放映空間——讓你喝著印尼拉茶，和同鄉一起大笑、大哭。</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="#events" class="btn-primary">看即將上映活動 →</a>
      <a href="#survey" class="btn-outline">填問卷抽好禮</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="floating-tag t2">🎙️ Big Lazy Seals Podcast</div>
    <div class="hero-card">
      <span class="soon-badge">即將到來</span>
      <div class="hero-card-tag">首場試營運活動</div>
      <div class="hero-card-title">印尼電影之夜<br>@ 中壢</div>
      <div class="hero-card-desc">大螢幕放映 × 印尼拉茶 × 家鄉零食<br>細節持續更新中，敬請期待！</div>
      <div class="hero-card-meta">
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>📍</strong>桃園中壢</div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>🎟️</strong>限量名額</div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>📅</strong>2026</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="floating-tag t1">🍵 印尼拉茶套餐</div>
  </div>
